{"id":"9e37f96b88bff2af","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-first-order-projection.md","title":"一阶投影","display":"df-first-order-projection — 一阶投影","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-first-order-projection","aliases":["29-df-first-order-projection"],"display":"df-first-order-projection — 一阶投影","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-query]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-term]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 11.7; Equation (11.8), pp.172–173, DjVu scans 187–188","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页187–188图像；数值守卫、互斥及单文字条件已逐项对照"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-first-order-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-first-order-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-projection — 一阶投影"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 11.7; Equation (11.8), pp.172–173, DjVu scans 187–188"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页187–188图像；数值守卫、互斥及单文字条件已逐项对照"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 为固定数值背景词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\{P_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,P_q^{(b_q)}\\}\">\\(\\rho=\\{P_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,P_q^{(b_q)}\\}\\)</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 不交的输入关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\nu\\cup\\rho\">\\(\\sigma=\\nu\\cup\\rho\\)</span> 不含函数符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 可以含固定的数值常量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N=(N_n)_{n\\geq1}\">\\(\\mathfrak N=(N_n)_{n\\geq1}\\)</span> 为给定的数值结构序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_n\">\\(N_n\\)</span> 的载体是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。下式构造输入论域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\)</span>；数值背景在给定长度上不随输入关系改变。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限关系输出词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为指定的合法输出论域。若输出含数值关系，其要求由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 一并指定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\">\\(\\Phi=(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\\)</span> 的变量分组和非空、常量唯一性接口沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\nu,\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Term}_\\nu\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\nu,\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Term}_\\nu\\)</span> 是对应词汇上的公式与项集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 见所列依赖。</li>\n<li>下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\alpha_i,\\lambda_j\">\\(\\theta,\\alpha_i,\\lambda_j\\)</span> 是公式树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=\\alpha_0\\lor\\bigvee_j(\\alpha_j\\land\\lambda_j)\">\\(\\theta=\\alpha_0\\lor\\bigvee_j(\\alpha_j\\land\\lambda_j)\\)</span> 是语法等式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为布尔查询。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{PFml}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOPSpec}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOPSpec}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOPQuery}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOPQuery}\\)</span> 与下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fop}\">\\(\\mathrm{fop}\\)</span> 分别标记下式引入的投影公式集、合法公式组集、查询集及归约关系；不作为额外原语使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_\\ell)\">\\(\\bigvee(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_\\ell)\\)</span> 表示非空有限公式序列按顺序析取，单项时为该项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid |A|=n\\land A\\!\\upharpoonright_\\nu=N_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid |A|=n\\land A\\!\\upharpoonright_\\nu=N_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_{\\rho,\\nu}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{P\\in\\rho}\\{P(\\bar t),\\neg P(\\bar t)\\mid\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\nu^{a(P)}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Lit}_{\\rho,\\nu}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{P\\in\\rho}\\{P(\\bar t),\\neg P(\\bar t)\\mid\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\nu^{a(P)}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFml}_{\\nu,\\rho}^{\\mathfrak N}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\ell\\geq0\\;\\exists(\\alpha_i)_{i=0}^{\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\nu^{\\ell+1}\n\\;\\exists(\\lambda_j)_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_{\\rho,\\nu}^{\\ell}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left[\n\\theta=\\bigvee\\bigl(\\alpha_0,(\\alpha_j\\land\\lambda_j)_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\bigr)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall i,j\\leq\\ell\\;\n\\left(i\\ne j\\to\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\n(A,\\beta)\\models\\neg(\\alpha_i\\land\\alpha_j)\\right)\n\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PFml}_{\\nu,\\rho}^{\\mathfrak N}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\ell\\geq0\\;\\exists(\\alpha_i)_{i=0}^{\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\nu^{\\ell+1}\n\\;\\exists(\\lambda_j)_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_{\\rho,\\nu}^{\\ell}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left[\n\\theta=\\bigvee\\bigl(\\alpha_0,(\\alpha_j\\land\\lambda_j)_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\bigr)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall i,j\\leq\\ell\\;\n\\left(i\\ne j\\to\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\n(A,\\beta)\\models\\neg(\\alpha_i\\land\\alpha_j)\\right)\n\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\mid\\varphi_0\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\nu\n\\land\\{\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}_{\\nu,\\rho}^{\\mathfrak N}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\mid\\varphi_0\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\nu\n\\land\\{\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}_{\\nu,\\rho}^{\\mathfrak N}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOPQuery}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\coloneqq\n\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}\\mid\n\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\n\\land I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}[\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FOPQuery}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\coloneqq\n\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}\\mid\n\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\n\\land I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}[\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\leq_{\\mathrm{fop}}^{\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal T\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOPQuery}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;(A\\in\\mathcal S\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S\\leq_{\\mathrm{fop}}^{\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal T\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOPQuery}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;(A\\in\\mathcal S\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 11.7 与式(11.8)，印刷页172–173、扫描页187–188。固定数值背景使守卫只依赖长度和位置；输入关系仅在单个正或负文字中出现。守卫互斥保证每个输出关系位至多查看一个输入关系位；没有守卫成立时输出假，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_0\">\\(\\alpha_0\\)</span> 成立时输出真。域公式必须完全数值化，输出常量的见证公式同样满足投影条件。</p>\n<p>本地接口把原书隐含的数值输入、输出要求显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span>，并限定可变输入符号为关系符号；可变输入常量须先采用关系编码，未在此暗加处理规则。标准数值符号怎样在元组输出域上解释，也不能省略为自动成立的条件。非空和常量单值性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adm}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{Adm}_k\\)</span> 保证，因此这里只收集已有良定义查询，并未从任意投影形状公式组宣称存在全函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","