a,\\alpha_i,\\lambda_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta=\\alpha_0\\lor\\bigvee_j(\\alpha_j\\land\\lambda_j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PFml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOPSpec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOPQuery}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid |A|=n\\land A\\!\\upharpoonright_\\nu=N_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_{\\rho,\\nu}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{P\\in\\rho}\\{P(\\bar t),\\neg P(\\bar t)\\mid\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\nu^{a(P)}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PFml}_{\\nu,\\rho}^{\\mathfrak N}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\exists\\ell\\geq0\\;\\exists(\\alpha_i)_{i=0}^{\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\nu^{\\ell+1}\n\\;\\exists(\\lambda_j)_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_{\\rho,\\nu}^{\\ell}\\;\\\\\n&\\quad\\left[\n\\theta=\\bigvee\\bigl(\\alpha_0,(\\alpha_j\\land\\lambda_j)_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\bigr)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall i,j\\leq\\ell\\;\n\\left(i\\ne j\\to\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\n(A,\\beta)\\models\\neg(\\alpha_i\\land\\alpha_j)\\right)\n\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\mid\\varphi_0\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\nu\n\\land\\{\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}_{\\nu,\\rho}^{\\mathfrak N}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOPQuery}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\coloneqq\n\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}\\mid\n\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\n\\land I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}[\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\leq_{\\mathrm{fop}}^{\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal T\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOPQuery}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;(A\\in\\mathcal S\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adm}_k","display":false}],"bytes":4729,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca9dcc9ec1866c06","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"范式性质说每个含任意嵌套调用的可定义查询，都能写成一次 $Q_S(I)$，其中 $I$ 的公式不含 $Q_S$。把这种性质写成模型类等价，避免误要求语法树逐字等于单调用节点。fo/fop/qfp分别约束 $I$ 的允许类型；合法性、数值背景与目标域不能在命题中省去。投影定义可查 [[29-df-first-order-projection]] 和 [[29-df-quantifier-free-projection]]，此处只有选用该特例时才使用它们。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-projection]]、[[29-df-first-order-projection]]、[[29-df-quantifier-free-projection]] — 非一致投影、fop、qfp"},{"id":"b5e158c134df5c1d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\nu=\\langle{\\leq}^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},0,\\max\\rangle$，$\\rho$、$\\sigma=\\nu\\cup\\rho$、$\\tau$、$\\mathfrak N$、$\\mathcal E$ 和 $\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}$ 沿用 [[29-df-first-order-projection]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-first-order-projection]]"}],"outgoing":["75340800e8905793","a3fa1d78e657e6a2","575d9a1532e3c73b","ac5c4072279f0088","3ee556c64b16809b","4de8e0c8085801f5"]}